('mhe-intro', 'minor-humanitarian-engineering', 0, 'Required: Introduction to Humanitarian Engineering and lab (4 credit hours)', 'all', null, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'The minor sheet lists this as FABENG 3201 (4); it''s now scheduled as FABENG 3210 with lab 3211.', null),
