('mhe-global', 'minor-humanitarian-engineering', 2, 'Global perspectives (one course)', 'choose_courses', 1, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'Development, food, health, cultural competency, and other courses that help you understand the communities you design for. AEDECON 4535 and 4532, BUSMHR 5530, ECON 4130, RURLSOC 3580, EARTHSC 3411, and INTSTDS 4532 have prerequisites.', null),
