('mhe-project', 'minor-humanitarian-engineering', 4, 'Culminating humanitarian engineering project (3 credit hours, final year)', 'manual', null, null, null, null, '{}'::text[], 'Individual studies, undergraduate research, honors thesis, or capstone design in any College of Engineering unit, focused on humanitarian engineering; the course''s faculty verify it on the HE Minor Student Information Form.', null),
